<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>War Hammer</h1>
<p>The war hammer is a one handed crushing war hammer design
we generally associate with the Norse deity Thor. It has
a short shaft and must be used with one hand. It is therefore
an extremely heavy weapon that can rarely be wielded by
anyone.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="In_Valhalla">In Valhalla</span></h2>
<p>In Valhalla the war hammer is a weapon skill of its own, one of the axes and hammers (see <a cmd='#'>Help Weapons</a>): one-handed, it bludgeons, it leans on strength, with some dexterity, and it is of middling speed. It is taught by the barbarians from guild level 10, the dark knights from guild level 10 (up to 80%), the fighters from guild level 10, the paladins from guild level 10 and the healers from guild level 10 (up to 80%). Practising it needs strength 90.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
